{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runehaven</strong> is an atmospheric roguelike dungeon crawler with an immersive magic system where you <strong>craft your own spells</strong>. Explore a dangerous and forsaken underground network on your journey to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/020a95ff793f319dac8fdeabfcd0a67f.avif?t=1770902710\" width=354 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/e4c85b06959dce31ffdcfa889883a692.poster.avif?t=1770902710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/e4c85b06959dce31ffdcfa889883a692.webm?t=1770902710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/e4c85b06959dce31ffdcfa889883a692.mp4?t=1770902710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an immersive magic system with endless possibilities. Craft your own spells by combining runes that you find in the world. Each rune has a unique effect on the spell. For example, combine a fire rune with a missile rune to craft a fire missile. Mix and match between over 25 runes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/968781211d1bae55aa7ad2489d6a4f0d.avif?t=1770902710\" width=354 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/488d52cb9d15a224e16a533f4c783e1d.poster.avif?t=1770902710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/488d52cb9d15a224e16a533f4c783e1d.webm?t=1770902710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/488d52cb9d15a224e16a533f4c783e1d.mp4?t=1770902710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runehaven features a fully destructible voxel world. Destroy the environment to find secrets, shortcuts, or to bypass locked entrances and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An immersive magic system where you craft your own spells by drawing rune combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully destructible and procedurally generated voxel world that both you and monsters can destroy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crisp voxel graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against 20 different monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of magic, melee and ranged weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bind spells to melee weapons and ranged weapons to enchant them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore distinct biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your runes with a rune book.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod support for creating your own weapons, props, items, biomes and worlds. There is also an integrated level editor included with the game.  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2676030?t=1770902710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770902710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/48534a0e4091c57adc479d718a54c9c1a8729a00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770902710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/48534a0e4091c57adc479d718a54c9c1a8729a00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770902710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2918260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runehaven</strong> is an atmospheric roguelike dungeon crawler with an immersive magic system where you <strong>craft your own spells</strong>. Explore a dangerous and forsaken underground network on your journey to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/020a95ff793f319dac8fdeabfcd0a67f.avif?t=1770902710\" width=354 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/e4c85b06959dce31ffdcfa889883a692.poster.avif?t=1770902710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/e4c85b06959dce31ffdcfa889883a692.webm?t=1770902710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/e4c85b06959dce31ffdcfa889883a692.mp4?t=1770902710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an immersive magic system with endless possibilities. Craft your own spells by combining runes that you find in the world. Each rune has a unique effect on the spell. For example, combine a fire rune with a missile rune to craft a fire missile. Mix and match between over 25 runes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/968781211d1bae55aa7ad2489d6a4f0d.avif?t=1770902710\" width=354 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/488d52cb9d15a224e16a533f4c783e1d.poster.avif?t=1770902710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/488d52cb9d15a224e16a533f4c783e1d.webm?t=1770902710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/488d52cb9d15a224e16a533f4c783e1d.mp4?t=1770902710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runehaven features a fully destructible voxel world. Destroy the environment to find secrets, shortcuts, or to bypass locked entrances and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An immersive magic system where you craft your own spells by drawing rune combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully destructible and procedurally generated voxel world that both you and monsters can destroy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crisp voxel graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against 20 different monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of magic, melee and ranged weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bind spells to melee weapons and ranged weapons to enchant them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore distinct biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your runes with a rune book.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod support for creating your own weapons, props, items, biomes and worlds. There is also an integrated level editor included with the game.  </p></li></ul>","developers":["Cikoria Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/46bb9af8122ebede6ca5aac17d9621095dd04d52/header.jpg?t=1770902710","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Runehaven","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 2.8 GHz / AMD FX-6300, 3.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 760, (2 GB VRAM) | AMD Radeon HD 7870, (2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-3770 | AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 560 with (